        "node_id": "n_3_223735",
        "thought_text": "Consider using regular expressions to identify and separate digits and operators before processing them. This approach ensures that only valid digits are converted to integers, avoiding errors during the evaluation process. Additionally, implement proper exception handling to manage unexpected inputs gracefully.",
